{"title":"2023 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1:_AM-GM_Inequality\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1: AM-GM Inequality</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:_Sum_Of_Squares\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2: Sum Of Squares</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_Algebraic_Method\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 Algebraic Method</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MOP_2024\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MOP 2024</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered pairs of positive real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> satisfy the equation\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/a/84a5218ec979bd23c38a0c1d454f8fefab75d9b2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+2a)(2+2b)(2a+b) = 32ab?\\]\" width=\"255\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd6e7f8a360e310d8a5ccaefc12ffd525113e729.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }3\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }\\text{an infinite number}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"480\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:_AM-GM_Inequality\">Solution 1: AM-GM Inequality</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1: AM-GM Inequality\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the AM-GM inequality on the two terms in each factor on the left-hand side, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e389fb9c2a257c18f4728e972399ebdea00faa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1+2a)(2+2b)(2a+b) \\ge 8\\sqrt{2a \\cdot 4b \\cdot 2ab}= 32ab,\\]\" width=\"388\" height=\"22\" />\nThis means the equality condition must be satisfied. Therefore, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fc4b9ffb7c0f3c350ea5d551547ad862d78940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 = 2a = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />, so the only solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ semistevehan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:_Sum_Of_Squares\">Solution 2: Sum Of Squares</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2: Sum Of Squares\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/2/a520e434900cd89e63792bb97666c8b54e74b4f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2a)(2+2b)(2a+b)=32ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" /> is equivalent to\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4f6744ca2710a7c03968ac3d6c157a825d2ffa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b(2a-1)^2+2a(b-1)^2+(2a-b)^2=0,\\]\" width=\"310\" height=\"20\" />\nwhere <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91a5b8b0bb9d8e27be1b824f08fd6df60ba1d9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/063deaa7db09df8b843e1d02622ed0129b976b14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a-1=b-1=2a-b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"222\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/7/817fb71dac79484254d56c05de06141b9f06a022.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=\\left(\\tfrac12,1\\right)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"110\" height=\"24\" />. Hence the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e101201addd96f637069ef5899fa2b44223efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3:\">Solution 3:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/8/3b89d5a116028dd892d2baa8b74612d609a8d3b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2a)(1+b)(2a+b)=16ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"242\" height=\"20\" />,\n</p><p>let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04d0034c66bd21885a33d39db69ed9c429373e55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2a, y=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />, then it becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/d/73d5de456d0cf53a104c0a8e180e7e1cd7fecbcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+x)(1+y)(x+y)=8xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"222\" height=\"20\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00c080655c41858cabcf3c2bc5acb815c72a1bdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+x+y+xy)(x+y)=8xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"241\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d5476fb6e1d52b32de45f876b4abf4d14c6d2d27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=x+y, \\beta=xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />, it becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae5db961723856a5c98db97f0d9f55380544a18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+\\alpha+\\beta)\\alpha=8\\beta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"149\" height=\"20\" />,\n</p><p>notice we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/d/a9d6b190a74c2ddbe6e68b0a6a4b39c128db3c13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2-4\\beta=(x-y)^2\\ge 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"21\" />, now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/4/28427549bff5d0cdec3c177ecd52205992ff4848.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta= \\frac{\\alpha(1+\\alpha)}{(8-\\alpha)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"110\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7ccc7dd7a9e051eaf8d65d76ca5bc582f7ed4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha^2\\ge 4\\beta=4\\alpha(1+\\alpha)/(8-\\alpha)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"234\" height=\"21\" /> (notice we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/3/3a31cfad1d288b03fb618dc00b1e3804ac1fc089.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8-\\alpha&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/a/a0a5696e940519ce52d4eb4779c8cce7dee622be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8-\\alpha)\\alpha\\ge 4(1+\\alpha)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"161\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66c7347bdcd66adaeebca597cd0823bfa5226288.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha-2)^2\\le 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/d/8cd26a67867e9ccfcb96e01c981f2187616a3a29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"47\" height=\"14\" />,\nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/0/bd0841c3936bc875fefe9192ca5209033f156466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\beta=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"18\" />, \n</p><p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/915f1781caa8b3e0eddafe7a445019f06178da22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd6067604bb233824ae37f8556686986f7ce1d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac12, b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"98\" height=\"38\" /> is the only solution.\n</p><p>answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbf3f49f7038e09844a0fc584865e168d73694e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~szhangmath\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_Algebraic_Method\">Solution 4 Algebraic Method</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 Algebraic Method\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/7/837361470871870690ea5e8f48a7f699d94520ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a3286609df8127438dc26ce96b853d7245be5a24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. The given equation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/813b55972b77dd82999feb6645f0a123cec852d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1+2a)(2+2b)(2a+b) = 32ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" />.\nExpanding the first two terms as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51bf3e58155f00535bd509d4d9f45007aecf73ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 + 2b + 4a + 4ab)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" /> and substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb9f6a44100f692897a381efe5b8f4259fab134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459db9e5904bb82daeb806d6252e3bf939649849.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2m + 4z + 2)m = 32z \\implies m^2 + (2z+1)m - 16z = 0 \\quad (1)\\]\" width=\"473\" height=\"20\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive reals, they are the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad517abd4af48d1ddbf4fbe02a8ba1ed4bf55b05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t^2 - mt + 2z = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"18\" />. For real roots, the discriminant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/9/819a98bec154e8be80fedc9f1316a59118a70da6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D = m^2 - 8z \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"19\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04f0320a9d871c8259c2ba29e0fe3ca6243886cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 \\geq 8z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>From <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f0b34a3d8e2194ab001890c052b72a0aaf55625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16z = m^2 + (2z+1)m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"21\" />. Substituting this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/a/eda552af57f3b08e5f3db4617990a2fb38ad0274.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16z \\leq 2m^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6fbc55cf46d7ac43d2f07d0aef24b9117c7a67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m^2 + (2z+1)m \\leq 2m^2 \\implies (2z+1)m \\leq m^2\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"20\" />\nSince <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/4/1d4f05dbfb8deab8d418a36643fded9383c604eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3362b5492afc4391d07bb661135bbec5bf0540.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\geq 2z+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"92\" height=\"16\" />. Substituting this boundary back into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/2/612b38360f7e526a99b7d202887e4a2f7d1d4fcf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(2z+1)^2 + (2z+1)(2z+1) - 16z \\leq 0\\]\" width=\"302\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/d/dfd8c9fbde2c3befac115486676333b3c71214e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2(4z^2 + 4z + 1) - 16z \\leq 0 \\implies 8z^2 - 8z + 2 \\leq 0 \\implies 2(2z-1)^2 \\leq 0\\]\" width=\"539\" height=\"20\" />\nThis forces <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/0/8c07d4168b8848a8ebf072ecf406e1049a385f14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2z-1)^2 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee461da3720a08bec307a2443b35be90442c5b23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />. \nPlugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/4/ee461da3720a08bec307a2443b35be90442c5b23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47caf3b6515a758fea0157c41cf574a3c83b5a92.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^2 + 2m - 8 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/3/6f3eaf8047a3f5bebfc5c43e27123a15a44d7540.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=2$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" /> (as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073b68444caca3c51f4ce50ee7fe4e5939755e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"13\" />).\nSolving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/1/1d126899d2676b064ed5212ba9a9a1c44e075cb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/0/4108262eb76cc28815de28b1306631017ff52779.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab=1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b920203c1ab20ac45056965b73a5f52e3b667032.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a, b) = (1/2, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />. \nThis is the only solution, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~PUER_137\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bRQ7xBm1hFc\">https://youtu.be/bRQ7xBm1hFc</a> \n~MathKatana\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LP4HSoaOCSU\">https://youtu.be/LP4HSoaOCSU</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MOP_2024\">Video Solution by MOP 2024</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MOP 2024\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/kkx7sm6-ZE8\">https://youtu.be/kkx7sm6-ZE8</a>\n</p><p>~r00tsOfUnity\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZKdnv8MsEDI\">https://youtu.be/ZKdnv8MsEDI</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\